                <head>No. 102.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish to General Schenck</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1876-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 17,
                        1876</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Officer, with papers for Winslow’s extradition, sails Saturday.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
